@startuml
title Consolidated Owner-Machine Validation Pipeline
start
:Preflight and secret safety;
:Cumulative static validators and unit tests;
if (Runtime mode?) then (yes)
  :Check Docker, Ollama and required models;
  :Apply migrations and seed synthetic tenants;
  :Run integration and tenant-isolation tests;
  :Build API and web application;
  :Probe PostgreSQL, Redis, MinIO, Qdrant and Ollama;
  if (Live preview enabled?) then (yes)
    :Launch API and web;
    :Playwright tests five roles at three breakpoints;
    :Capture screenshots and failure traces;
  endif
endif
:Redact logs and generate JSON/Markdown report;
if (Any failure?) then (yes)
  :Keep validation_pending;
else (no)
  :Set validated_on_owner_machine;
endif
stop
@enduml
